	"Description": "[u][size=5]Author's Note[/size][/u][size=5]: [/size]Try using the amazing\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3109?tab=description]Automatic Gates[/url]\u00A0Mod it pairs VERY nicely with my particular gates &lt;3 (which are arches)\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Do YOU need a fence for your highly specific playthrough of mods? Well, here's one to try! With Pocky and Pretzel fencing anything can be made into a cuterific flavortastic cute wonderland\n<br />\n<br />[b][i][u][size=5]Disclaimer:[/size]\n<br />[/u][/i][/b]**DO NOT** Put a gate on a fence if you want it to be one of the variants of gate as AT will try to turn it into a fence which doesn't break anything, but it won't look as good.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b][i][size=4]PLANNED FENCES/GATES IN THE FUTURE:[/size][/i][/b]\n<br />\n<br />- Swiss Roll fence?\n<br />\n<br />- Pocky flavors?",
